{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"hannibal-buress","name":"Hannibal Buress","birthDate":"1983-02-04","birthPlace":"Chicago, Illinois, USA","bio":"Hannibal Amir Buress (/ˈbʌrɪs/ BURR-iss; born February 4, 1983) is an American comedian, actor, producer, writer, musician, and venue owner. He started performing comedy in 2002 while attending Southern Illinois University. He starred on Adult Swim's The Eric Andre Show from 2012 to 2020, and was featured on Comedy Central's Broad City from 2014 to 2019. He is also known for his October 16, 2014, stand-up routine, which brought the sexual assault allegations against Bill Cosby to public attention and outcry, for which he was lauded.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Hannibal Buress, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:43:44+00:00","tmdbId":500427,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/500427","credits":[{"id":"spider-home","title":"Spider-Man: Homecoming","character":"Coach Wilson","characterFa":"مربی ویلسون"},{"id":"spider-no","title":"Spider-Man: No Way Home","character":"Coach Wilson","characterFa":"مربی ویلسون"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/hannibal-buress.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Everybody's Live with John Mulaney","year":2025,"character":"Self - Comedian and Rapper, 5'10\"","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/c9hRxGJh6FjArAEpHnfk2IMkRkC.jpg"},{"name":"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem","year":2023,"character":"Genghis Frog (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gyh0eECE2IqrW8GWl3KoHBfc45j.jpg"},{"name":"Out of the Loop","year":2023,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tcXdKnmzcZGrrgI9B2oQ3hysBAy.jpg"},{"name":"Mo","year":2022,"character":"Denato","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/x3ojdK36AKestQaL2nAE6A7JYWO.jpg"},{"name":"Spider-Man: No Way Home","year":2021,"character":"Coach Wilson"